1
00:00:00,198 --> 00:00:03,138
(Amy:)Sorry, we've cut the monkeys down
to one cigarette a day...

2
00:00:03,301 --> 00:00:05,061
(Amy:)...so things are a little intense.

3
00:00:06,571 --> 00:00:11,201
(Amy:)Makes me miss my marijuana-abusing
flatworms. Those guys were mellow.

4
00:00:12,010 --> 00:00:16,210
(Sheldon:)Good news, uh, the latest episode
of Fun With Flags is online.

5
00:00:16,381 --> 00:00:20,081
- Oh, that's right. How'd it go with Penny?
- Much better than I expected.

6
00:00:20,285 --> 00:00:24,845
(Sheldon:)She even gave me some helpful tips
about acting and body language.

7
00:00:25,023 --> 00:00:26,083
(Sheldon:)Watch.

8
00:00:27,392 --> 00:00:29,322
(Sheldon:)Welcome to my world.

9
00:00:30,662 --> 00:00:32,182
(Sheldon:)Not welcome to my world.

10
00:00:34,099 --> 00:00:36,689
(Sheldon:)Welcome.
Not welcome.

11
00:00:37,869 --> 00:00:39,859
(Amy:)Subtle but powerful.

12
00:00:40,038 --> 00:00:43,198
(Sheldon:)I know, I'm still learning to control it.

13
00:00:44,042 --> 00:00:46,032
(Amy:)Did you tell Penny how helpful she was?

14
00:00:46,511 --> 00:00:47,601
(Sheldon:)Why would I do that?

15
00:00:48,580 --> 00:00:51,070
(Amy:)Because she's your friend
and she did a nice job.

16
00:00:51,249 --> 00:00:52,879
(Amy:)I'm sure she'd like to hear it.

17
00:00:54,686 --> 00:00:56,246
(Sheldon:)All right.

18
00:00:56,721 --> 00:01:01,021
(Amy:)I didn't mean now. Hello?

